      "releaseNotes": "• Updated the app’s interface and navigation to align with SharePoint Discover on the web.\n• Added Overview, Sites, People, News, Recent, and Favorites tabs.\n• Overview brings together relevant content, recent items, favorite items, site activity, and updates from coworkers.\n• Added in-app previews for Word, Excel, PowerPoint, PDFs, images, and videos.\n• Updated the search interface for finding content across SharePoint and within sites.\n• Updated the News view with unread and source filters.\n• Replaced Save for Later with Favorites for saving news and pages.\n• Added dark mode support.",
